      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_02C_DSG_LOC|sta20_amb_parks_wealthy_D|85353",
      "en": "That's nothing. I've had my office rearranged five times now.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_02C_DSG_LOC|sta20_amb_parks_wealthy_D|85354",
      "en": "Five times? But why? What do they want?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_02C_DSG_LOC|sta20_amb_parks_wealthy_D|85355",
      "en": "How should I know? It's not like keepers offer an explanation for what they're doing.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_02C_DSG_LOC|sta20_amb_parks_wealthy_D|85356",
      "en": "And yet everyone just lets them go on doing whatever it is they do.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_02C_DSG_LOC|sta20_amb_parks_wealthy_D|85357",
      "en": "What choice do we have? If you try to stop them, they just shut down and another one replaces it.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_02C_DSG_LOC|sta20_amb_parks_wealthy_D|85358",
      "en": "It's just strange that we know so little about them.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_02C_DSG_LOC|sta20_amb_parks_wealthy_D|85359",
      "en": "Not to mention frustrating.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_02C_DSG_LOC|sta20_amb_parks_wealthy_D|85360",
      "en": "I went fairly often when it was still the Archos.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_02C_DSG_LOC|sta20_amb_parks_wealthy_D|85361",
      "en": "Yeah, ever since Fist took over, I don't go any more.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_02C_DSG_LOC|sta20_amb_parks_wealthy_D|85362",
      "en": "It seems like all the best lounges are being replaced by places like Chora's Den.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_02C_DSG_LOC|sta20_amb_parks_wealthy_D|85363",
      "en": "The embassy lounge isn't bad, but they don't have any decent entertainment.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_02C_DSG_LOC|sta20_amb_parks_wealthy_D|85364",
      "en": "It's run by bureaucrats. They probably spend months just voting on what kind of entertainment to get. ",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_02C_DSG_LOC|sta20_amb_parks_wealthy_D|85365",
      "en": "Ha! You're probably right.",
      "tr": ""
    }
  ]
